<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Stakeholder Profile: {{ name_role }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Stakeholder Profile: {{ name_role }}</h1>
<p><strong>Initiative:</strong> {{ name }} <strong>Stakeholder ID:</strong> S-{{ stakeholder_id }} <strong>Last Updated:</strong> {{ last_reviewed_date }}</p>
<h2>Basic Information</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> {{ name }}</li><li><strong>Title:</strong> {{ title }}</li><li><strong>Department:</strong> {{ dept }}</li><li><strong>Category:</strong> Customer / EndUser / Sponsor / DomainSME / ImplementationSME / Tester / Regulator / Supplier</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> {{ email }}</li></ul>
<h2>Characteristics</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Influence Level:</strong> High / Medium / Low</li><li><strong>Impact Level:</strong> High / Medium / Low</li><li><strong>Attitude:</strong> + (supportive) / 0 (neutral) / - (resistant) / unknown</li><li><strong>Attitude Evidence:</strong> &quot;{{ attitude_evidence }}&quot;</li><li><strong>Quadrant:</strong> Manage Closely / Keep Satisfied / Keep Informed / Monitor</li><li><strong>Knowledge Area:</strong> {{ domain_expertise }}</li></ul>
<h2>Needs and Expectations</h2>
<ul><li>[Need 1 — outcome-shaped, sourced from elicitation]</li><li>{{ need_2 }}</li></ul>
<h2>Concerns</h2>
<ul><li>[Concern 1 — verbatim or paraphrased from elicitation with source]</li><li>{{ concern_2 }}</li></ul>
<h2>Communication Preferences</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Preferred Method:</strong> Email / Meeting / Slack / Phone</li><li><strong>Frequency:</strong> Per quadrant default / [Override with rationale]</li><li><strong>Detail Level:</strong> Executive summary / Detailed / Technical</li><li><strong>Timezone/Availability:</strong> {{ constraints }}</li></ul>
<h2>Engagement Strategy</h2>
<p>[How to work with this stakeholder — specific to their quadrant, attitude, and concerns]</p>
<h2>Salience Overlay (for high-stakes initiatives)</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Power:</strong> High / Medium / Low — {{ basis }}</li><li><strong>Legitimacy:</strong> High / Medium / Low — {{ basis }}</li><li><strong>Urgency:</strong> High / Medium / Low — {{ basis }}</li><li><strong>Salience Class:</strong> Definitive (all 3) / Dominant / Dependent / Dangerous / Discretionary / Demanding / Dormant / Non-stakeholder</li></ul>
<h2>Engagement History</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Type</th><th>Summary</th><th>Follow-up</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ date }}</td><td>Interview / Workshop / Email</td><td>{{ brief_summary }}</td><td>{{ action }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
</body></html>
